      "content": "Wait, what? Why are you talking about goblins and markets? I'm just asking about my luggage and the station. \n\nCan you just ignore that and give me the actual info? If I have multiple bags, do I have to check them all at a desk or can I take them through the gates myself? And you got cut off at the end—what were you saying about the corridors?",
